    "publisher": "Belfast Telegraph (via the British Newspaper Archive)",
    "kind": "news",
    "check": "returned unopposed: 'There are three vacant seats, and the retiring members are Messrs. S. M'Knight, W. H. Loughran, and S. Gaskin. Mr. Gaskin did not seek reelection. Mr. John Mulholland, farmer, was duly nominated with the two retiring members mentioned.'",
